{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Liquid and CSS developer. Build a fully responsive custom section that perfectly replicates the layout, design hierarchy, spacing, and typography of the provided reference image "image_6c0066.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration, Max Width & Basic Styles
    - **Theme Typography & Width:** The section must seamlessly inherit the active theme's native font styles (via `var(--font-heading-family)` and `var(--font-body-family)`) and strictly honor the standard maximum section layout width (e.g., matching `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers).
    - **Section Background:** Pure white background (#FFFFFF) with comfortable, clean padding at the top and bottom.
    - **Main Box Container:** Wrap the internal content elements inside a large, horizontally centered card card.
      - Background: A very clean, ultra-light desaturated gray-blue or off-white wash background tint.
      - Border: A very thin, crisp light-gray outline stroke.
      - Shape: Clean rounded corners (border-radius: 16px).
      - Spacing: Deep, even internal padding to frame the grid column elements comfortably.
    
    ### 2. Section Header Group
    Centered perfectly at the top of the internal card, with ample breathing room underneath:
    - **Main Heading:** "Featured & Referenced"
      - Styling: Exceptionally bold, clean, deep navy blue text color (#11243E).
    - **Subheading Text:** "Flow's approach to retail analytics has been recognized by industry publications and research."
      - Styling: Muted slate-gray text with generous line-height to ensure pristine readability.
    
    ### 3. Asymmetric 3-Column Feature Grid
    Below the header group, render a 3-column horizontal block configuration on desktop. On mobile, the grid items must stack vertically with uniform spacing.
    - **Grid Item Architecture:** Each block must align everything perfectly center and feature:
      - **Icon Box Element:** A crisp white, floating square card element featuring comfortable padding, smooth rounded corners (border-radius: 12px), and a very thin light-gray outline border. Each container must anchor a clean, thin line-art SVG icon matching the context:
        - Block 1 Icon: An open book line-art SVG icon.
        - Block 2 Icon: A hanging ribbon/award badge line-art SVG icon.
        - Block 3 Icon: A user/profile outline group line-art SVG icon.
      - **Feature Title:** A short, bold title using the deep navy blue color theme (#11243E).
      - **Feature Description:** A small, lower-contrast slate-gray text paragraph nestled tightly below the title.
    
    ### 4. Centered Call-To-Action (CTA) Button
    Positioned perfectly center-aligned below the 3-column layout structure:
    - **Button Styling:** A prominent rectangular capsule button.
      - Background Color: Solid deep navy blue (#11243E).
      - Text Color: High-contrast crisp white (#FFFFFF).
      - Shape: Rounded corners (border-radius: 8px or pill shape).
      - Interaction Elements: Inline right-facing arrow asset (`→`) trailing the button string label.
    
    ### 5. Exact Content Text Map for 100% Replication
    Ensure the theme schema default settings map exactly to this English copy copy:
    
    - **Block 1 (Left):**
      - Title: Industry Publications
      - Description: Featured in retail technology research and case studies
    - **Block 2 (Center):**
      - Title: Customer Success Stories
      - Description: Documented deployments across major retail brands
    - **Block 3 (Right):**
      - Title: Retail Community
      - Description: Active participation in Japanese retail industry forums
    - **CTA Button Label:** View Customer Case Studies
    
    ### 6. Liquid Schema & Custom CSS Requirements
    - Code the layout to make titles, descriptions, icons, and button URLs dynamically manageable using structured block entries (`blocks`) inside the Liquid schema architecture.
    - Wrap all custom styling selectors into a `<style>` block scoped directly to the unique section ID (`#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}`) to strictly enforce absolute zero style leakage across other templates.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-featured-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-featured-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 60px 40px;
  }

  .ai-featured-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .ai-featured-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-featured-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .ai-featured-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-featured-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-featured-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    stroke: #11243E;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-featured-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #11243E;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-featured-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-featured-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-featured-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background-color: #11243E;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-featured-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #0d1b2f;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {

    .ai-featured-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }

    .ai-featured-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-featured-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-featured-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    .ai-featured-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-featured-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-featured-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-featured-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-featured-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="ai-featured-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
        <p class="ai-featured-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-featured-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-featured-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-featured-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"></path>
              <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-featured-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_1_title }}</h3>
          <p class="ai-featured-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_1_description }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-featured-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-featured-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle>
              <path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-featured-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_2_title }}</h3>
          <p class="ai-featured-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_2_description }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-featured-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-featured-icon-box-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
              <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="ai-featured-item-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_3_title }}</h3>
          <p class="ai-featured-item-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_3_description }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-featured-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-featured-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FeaturedSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }
    customElements.define('featured-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FeaturedSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

